    "Any latency problems likely come from the Wi-Fi segment, disconnects, or ISP congestion at certain times. Use continuous monitoring and Wi-Fi Events to narrow it down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "遅延の原因があるとすれば、Wi-Fi 区間・切断・時間帯による回線の混雑です。常時計測と「Wi-Fi イベント」で切り分けてください。"
