    "Click Measure Speed to test download and upload speed, and responsiveness (RPM) while the connection is saturated." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「速度を測る」を押すと、下り・上りの速度と、回線が埋まったときの応答性（RPM）を測ります。"
