    "Download Saturated" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下りを埋めたとき"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "During a scan the radio leaves your channel, pausing traffic for a few hundred milliseconds each time. Many from locationd means Location Services; sharingd means AirDrop discovery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "スキャン中はチャンネルを離れるので、1回あたり数百ms通信が止まります。locationd が多ければ位置情報サービス、sharingd なら AirDrop の相手探索です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each scan pauses your own traffic for a few hundred milliseconds, so use auto-scan only when needed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "スキャン中は自分の通信も数百ms止まるため、自動スキャンは必要なときだけ使ってください"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Elapsed (s)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "経過秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable QoS / SQM on your router, or limit upload bandwidth to about 90% of the measured speed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ルーターの QoS / SQM を有効にするか、上り帯域を実測値の90%程度に制限してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enabling QoS / SQM (fq_codel or cake) on your router, or limiting upload bandwidth to about 90% of the measured speed, will help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ルーターの QoS / SQM（fq_codel・cake）を有効にするか、上り帯域を実測値の90%程度に制限すると改善します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Epson" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "エプソン"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Espressif (IoT device)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Espressif（IoT機器）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Evaluating" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "判定中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Even a single disconnect stops traffic for several seconds. Reason codes: 3 = leaving, 4 = inactivity timeout, 8 = disconnected by the access point." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切断が1回でもあれば、その瞬間の通信は数秒止まります。reason code 3=離脱, 4=無通信タイムアウト, 8=AP側から切断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Even pings to the router are delayed, so the congestion is on the Wi-Fi segment or in the router itself. Suspect the signal, the channel, or the router’s processing power." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ルーター宛てでも待たされています。詰まっているのは Wi-Fi 区間かルーター本体です。電波・チャンネル・ルーターの処理能力を疑ってください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Evening" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "夕方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Evening. Congestion starts rising as people get home." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "夕方。帰宅に合わせて混雑が増え始める時間帯です。"
          }
        }
      }
