            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ライト"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lines are medians; bands extend to the maximum. Red vertical lines mark packet loss. Gray shading marks time left out of the score (speed tests, load tests, device scans). Logarithmic scale." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "線は中央値、帯は最大値までの幅。赤い縦線はパケットロス。灰色の帯はスコアから外した時間（速度測定・負荷試験・機器の検索）。縦軸は対数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lines show the maximum for each second, so spikes are visible as they happen. Gray shading marks time left out of the score (speed tests, load tests, device scans)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "線はそれぞれの秒の最大値。跳ね上がりがそのまま見えます。灰色の帯はスコアから外した時間（速度測定・負荷試験・機器の検索）。"
          }
