    "Measure speed and responsiveness with networkQuality" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "networkQuality で速度と応答性を測ります"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measured %@ · Responsiveness (RPM) is how many round trips per minute the connection can make while it is saturated. Apple’s guide: good = 800 or more, fair = 300–800, poor = under 300. Under 300 suggests bufferbloat; use Load Test to find which segment is responsible." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ に測定 · 応答性（RPM）は「回線が埋まっているときに1分あたり何往復できるか」。Apple の目安は 良い=800以上、普通=300〜800、悪い=300未満。300未満ならバッファブロートを疑い、「負荷試験」で区間を切り分けてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measuring" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "計測中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measuring…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "測定しています…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Median" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中央値"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Median every 5 seconds. The gap between the lines is the SNR — the wider, the better." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "5秒ごとの中央値。間の幅が SN比で、広いほど余裕があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Medians of the per-minute records, grouped by hour. If only certain hours are bad, suspect congestion at your ISP." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1分ごとの記録を時刻別にまとめた中央値。特定の時間帯だけ悪いなら回線側（ISPの輻輳）が疑われます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
