      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "おすすめ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Record Location" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "記録の保存先"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Records" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "記録"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Records accumulate every minute while the app is running. Keep it running for half a day to a full day, including the times problems occur." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリを起動している間、1分ごとに記録が溜まります。症状が出る時間帯を含めて、半日〜1日ほど動かし続けてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Records are kept for each router. If the same network was recorded twice (for example, before and after the router’s address could be read), merge one into the other. Merging doesn’t change the record files and can be undone with Separate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "記録はルーターごとに分けています。同じネットワークが2つに分かれて記録されたとき（ルーターのアドレスが読めるようになる前と後など）は、片方をもう片方にまとめてください。まとめても記録のファイルは変わらず、「分ける」で元に戻せます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Records are kept separately for each network (router)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "記録はネットワーク（ルーター）ごとに分けています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Records are stored as JSON Lines, the same format as the Wi-Fi Pulse diagnostic kit. Point this at the kit’s data folder to analyze them with tools/report.py as well." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "形式は Wi-Fi Pulse 診断キットと同じ JSON Lines です。キットの data フォルダを指定すれば、tools/report.py でもそのまま集計できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Records of sharing 2.4 GHz airtime with Bluetooth devices. If there are many, moving to 5 GHz may help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2.4GHz 帯で Bluetooth 機器と電波を分け合っている記録。多ければ 5GHz に寄せると改善することがあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recovery" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回復待ち"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reload" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "再読み込み"
          }
        }
      }
