    "This can’t be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この操作は取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a private Wi-Fi address (randomized MAC). iPhone, iPad, Mac, and others use a different address on each network, so the manufacturer can’t be identified." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "プライベート Wi-Fi アドレス（ランダム化されたMAC）です。iPhone・iPad・Mac などは、ネットワークごとに別のアドレスを使うため、メーカー名が分かりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "時刻"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time to resolve www.apple.com via your router’s DNS (every 10 seconds)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ルーターの DNS に www.apple.com を問い合わせた時間（10秒ごと）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To isolate it, temporarily disable it in Terminal during a call (AirDrop, Sidecar, and Handoff stop working; restarting also restores it):" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切り分けたいときは、通話中にターミナルで一時的に止めます（AirDrop・Sidecar・Handoff が止まります。再起動でも戻ります）:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To the Internet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
