    "Traffic for AirDrop, AirPlay, Handoff, and Sidecar. The Wi-Fi chip periodically hops to another channel, causing regular latency spikes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirDrop・AirPlay・Handoff・Sidecar 用の通信。Wi-Fi チップが定期的に別チャンネルへ出張するため、周期的なスパイクが出ます。"
