          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses macOS’s built-in networkQuality. It briefly saturates your connection, so let others on your network know first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 標準の networkQuality で測ります。回線を一時的に埋めるので、同居人がいれば一声かけてから。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Utilization" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "利用率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verdict" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "判定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Very bad. Other traffic stalls for seconds during transfers" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "非常に悪い。通信中にほかの通信が数秒止まる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View Options" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "表示オプション"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "W53 (channels 52–64) and W56 (100–144) are DFS channels: when radar is detected, the router stops transmitting for up to 60 seconds. For stability, choose W52 (channels 36–48)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "W53（52〜64ch）・W56（100〜144ch）は DFS 対象で、レーダーを検出するとルーターが最大60秒送信を止めます。安定性を優先するなら W52（36〜48ch）を選びます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WEP (insecure)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "WEP（危険）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WPA2 Enterprise" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "WPA2 エンタープライズ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WPA3 Enterprise" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "WPA3 エンタープライズ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting a few seconds after launch so start-up activity doesn’t affect the score." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "起動直後の乱れがスコアに入らないよう、数秒待っています。"
