            "value" : "休日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Is Collected" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取得するもの"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the connection is busy, real-time communication barely works." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回線が混むと、リアルタイムの通信がまともに成立しない水準です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the connection saturates, latency jumps to hundreds of milliseconds or several seconds. This is why calls and games freeze during large downloads." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回線が埋まった瞬間に、遅延が数百ms〜数秒に跳ね上がります。大きなダウンロード中に通話やゲームが止まるのはこれが原因です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When weather or aviation radar is detected, the router can’t transmit at all for up to 60 seconds — a classic cause of traffic stalling for tens of seconds. Fixing your router to W52 (channels 36/40/44/48) stops it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "気象・航空レーダーを検出すると、ルーターは最大60秒まったく送信できなくなります。通信が数十秒止まる症状の典型原因です。ルーターのチャンネルを W52（36/40/44/48ch）に固定すると止まります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the Delay Is" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "どこで遅れているか"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who Requested Scans" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "誰がスキャンを要求したか"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wi-Fi接続"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi Connection" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wi-Fi 接続"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi Events" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wi-Fi イベント"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi Pulse" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "Wi-Fi is fine. The delay is on the Internet side (your ISP or the route)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wi-Fi は正常です。遅れはインターネット回線側（プロバイダや経路）で起きています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi is fine; the delay is at your ISP or further along the route." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wi-Fi は正常で、遅れはプロバイダ側か経路で起きています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi segment" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wi-Fi区間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wired" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有線接続"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless conditions are poor and packets are lost on the way to the router." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無線の状態が悪く、ルーターまでの間でパケットが失われています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With mesh systems or extenders, devices can bounce between access points, causing repeated 1–3 second dropouts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "メッシュや中継器があると、端末が行ったり来たりして1〜3秒の断が繰り返し起きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also change this in System Settings › General › Language & Region › Applications." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "システム設定 › 一般 › 言語と地域 › アプリケーション からも変更できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Channel" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自分のチャンネル"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re far from the router or something is in the way. Moving closer will help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ルーターから遠いか、間に障害物があります。ルーターに近づくと改善します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
